Two real tickets:

Cosmetic bug on the checkout page, during a sale	Internal dev tool completely down
How bad	Every customer sees it — high impact	8 engineers affected — moderate impact
How fast	Nobody is blocked, no clock — low urgency	Release blocked today — high urgency
One flat score	~50	~50
Same number. Opposite responses. One waits for the next sprint; one is worked now.

Keep them on separate axes and nothing is lost. Pick a row (how bad), pick a column (how fast), read the cell:

Impact ↓ / Urgency →	Critical	High	Medium	Low
Extensive	P1	P1	P2	P3
Significant	P1	P2	P2	P3
Moderate	P2	P3	P3	P4
Minor	P3	P3	P4	P4
The checkout bug lands Extensive × Low → P3. The dev tool lands Moderate × High → P3
